note Compose committed gate core + github.om + repository-screen.om + check.om
note + github-fixtures.om + this file. Exit0 means every behavioral assertion passed.
note Fixtures never enter production composition. Network/TLS are not tested here.
text Gxask "Please find your current Git repo"
text Gxask2 "Allen, could you open the GitHub repository?"
text Gxno "Create a repository for another project"
text Gxesc "{\"full_name\":\"aien-dev/allen\",\"private\":false,\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/aien-dev/allen\",\"default_branch\":\"feature/demo\",\"description\":\"say \\\"hi\\\" \\\\ \\u00e9 \\ud83d\\ude00\"}"
