fn gxmeta to void
for i ulong len Gxmeta
put Ghbody i get Gxmeta i
end
check ghreply 1 200 len Gxmeta get Ghreq 2 100
end
fn gxcommit to void
for i ulong len Gxcommit
put Ghbody i get Gxcommit i
end
check ghreply 2 200 len Gxcommit get Ghreq 2 101
end
fn gxfiles to void
for i ulong len Gxfiles
put Ghbody i get Gxfiles i
end
check ghreply 4 200 len Gxfiles get Ghreq 2 102
end
fn gxread to void
note Enough actual input rows to exercise paging, not a pre-rendered card.
for i ulong 200
put Ghbody mul i 2 65
put Ghbody add mul i 2 1 10
end
check ghreply 3 200 400 get Ghreq 2 103
end
fn gxlist to void
for i ulong len Gxlist
put Ghbody i get Gxlist i
end
check ghreply 5 200 len Gxlist get Ghreq 2 150
end
note Every live session starts with discovery; gxfind is refresh plus a valid listing.
fn gxfind to void
ghrefresh
gxlist
check eq get Ghreq 0 1 151
end
fn gxlfail n ulong id ulong to void
ghrefresh
check eq get Ghreq 0 5 id
check ghreply 5 200 n get Ghreq 2 add id 1
check eq get Gh 0 3 add id 2
check eq get Gh 2 3 add id 3
check eq get Ghreq 0 0 add id 4
check eq get Ghlen 5 0 add id 5
end
fn gxdiscover to void
ghinit
gxfind
check eq get Ghlen 5 14 160
check eq get Ghlen 6 20 161
check eq get Ghreq 1 len Gxlbase 162
for i ulong len Gxlbase
check eq get Ghpath i get Gxlbase i 163
end
check eq get Ghmeta 784 50 164
gxmeta
check eq get Ghreq 0 2 165
for i ulong len Gxlowner
put Ghbody i get Gxlowner i
end
gxlfail len Gxlowner 170
for i ulong len Gxldot
put Ghbody i get Gxldot i
end
gxlfail len Gxldot 176
for i ulong len Gxlslash
put Ghbody i get Gxlslash i
end
gxlfail len Gxlslash 182
for i ulong len Gxlbare
put Ghbody i get Gxlbare i
end
gxlfail len Gxlbare 188
for i ulong len Gxldate
put Ghbody i get Gxldate i
end
gxlfail len Gxldate 194
for i ulong len Gxlnod
put Ghbody i get Gxlnod i
end
gxlfail len Gxlnod 200
for i ulong len Gxldup
put Ghbody i get Gxldup i
end
gxlfail len Gxldup 206
for i ulong len Gxlempty
put Ghbody i get Gxlempty i
end
gxlfail len Gxlempty 212
for i ulong len Gxlobj
put Ghbody i get Gxlobj i
end
gxlfail len Gxlobj 218
ghrefresh
check ghreply 5 429 0 get Ghreq 2 224
check eq get Gh 2 4 225
check eq get Ghlen 5 0 226
end
fn gxready to void
gxfind
gxmeta
gxcommit
gxread
gxfiles
check eq get Gh 0 2 104
end
fn gxintent to void
ghinit
for i ulong len Gxask
put In i get Gxask i
end
put Inlen 0 len Gxask
check ghask 1
check eq get Ghreq 0 5 2
check eq get Ghreq 1 len Ghlst 3
for i ulong len Ghlst
check eq get Ghpath i get Ghlst i 4
end
for i ulong len Gxask2
put In i get Gxask2 i
end
put Inlen 0 len Gxask2
check ghask 5
for i ulong len Gxno
put In i get Gxno i
end
put Inlen 0 len Gxno
check not ghask 6
check eq get Gh 0 4 7
check eq get Ghreq 0 0 8
end
fn gxlive to void
ghrefresh
old = get Ghreq 2
gxfind
check not ghreply 1 200 len Gxmeta old 10
check eq get Ghreq 0 1 11
check not ghreply 2 200 len Gxmeta get Ghreq 2 12
ghtime 1792886400
gxmeta
check eq get Ghreq 0 2 13
check eq get Ghlen 1 4 14
check eq get Ghmeta 64 109 15
check eq get Ghmeta 67 110 16
check eq get Ghat 0 1792886400 17
gxcommit
check eq get Ghlen 3 40 18
check eq get Ghlen 4 20 19
check eq get Ghreq 3 1 20
check eq get Ghreq 0 3 21
gxread
check eq get Ghreq 0 4 22
check eq get Ghreq 1 len Gxroot 23
for i ulong len Gxroot
check eq get Ghpath i get Gxroot i 24
end
gxfiles
check eq get Gh 0 2 25
check eq get Ghreq 0 0 26
check eq get Gh 8 9 27
check eq get Ghfiles 1 10 28
check eq get Ghfiles 3 197 29
check not ghreply 4 200 len Gxfiles get Ghreq 2 30
end
